    {
      "id": "03-fats",
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "fats",
      "text": "30.7 grams of fat. Omega 3 is huge at 17.83 grams, which is the main reason chia stands out. Saturated fat is 3.3 grams, so it stays fairly controlled for such a fatty seed. Polyunsaturated fat is 23.7 grams, another strong fat-quality mark. For seeds, fat quality is a big part of the ranking.",
      "textSha256": "d3277cfa0ff703eba27de3e6dd52c8481f5fde8699bb44805b60400e18dd6ede",
      "characterCount": 294,
      "byteLength": 362832,
